Java Liberaries 
it is a collection of pre-defined in built java components like classes , interface , Annotations ect

A liberarie typically contains compressed JAR File
for the JAR Files contains Multiple packages
the package contains classes and interface.

Example:-

JRE System Liberary
|
|
------(JAR Files)java.base-------
|                    |
------java,Sql       |
                     |
                     |
                     ----------(packages) java.lang -----------(classes or interfaces) object  ,   System  ,  String
                               java.util-----------Scanner  ,  ArrayList , Optional
                               java.io-------------FileReader  ,  FileInputStream
